_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":113,"digest":"sha256:2b45c69db49ff40a0cc8c41e3a40109ecb0957c4ef34e236f8e42370b2dc9a37","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-06T16:50:23Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T16:50:23Z"}],"body":"## FluentCI 0.17.1\r\n\r\nThis release adds multiple workflows, reproducible module dependencies, built-in service management, and a searchable module registry.\r\n\r\n### Highlights\r\n\r\n- Multiple workflows — define workflows in .fluentci/workflows, configure CI triggers, and manage them in Studio.\r\n- Registry modules — invoke modules directly by name or URL. Official modules can omit the @fluentci.io/ prefix.\r\n- Reproducible dependencies — pin resolved module versions with fluentci.lock.\r\n- Built-in services — manage background services, readiness checks, logs, and lifecycle.\r\n- Compiled DAG execution — improved scheduling for complex pipelines, plus composable remote, platform, and digest primitives.\r\n\r\n### Publishing and discovery\r\n\r\n- Interactive publishing prompts with per-module versions and metadata.\r\n- Function signatures, repository links, README URLs, logos, topics, OS, and CPU architecture metadata.\r\n- Searchable module pages with highlighted README code, download totals, and interactive weekly download charts.\r\n\r\n### Studio\r\n\r\n- Git branch switching and pull controls.\r\n- Readable Tangled repository suggestions.\r\n- Pinned workflow controls and expanded job headers.\r\n- Improved registry suggestions and module logos.\r\n\r\n### Distribution and fixes\r\n\r\n- Improved OpenBSD release bootstrapping.\r\n- DEB/RPM packaging and Gemfury uploads.\r\n- Cachix integration and restored FlakeHub/Flakestry publishing.\r\n- CI fixes, installer updates, and expanded documentation.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/fluentci-io/fluentci/compare/v0.17.0...v0.17.1"}
